WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.958
Step 1: Open the location selector and choose Head Office. Authorised managers can create it by selecting this option if it is missing. It opens without a store setup checklist. Selecting a store shows its Store dashboard; Staff profiles keep an operational dashboard without sales.

2
00:00:14.958 --> 00:00:30.833
Step 2: On Head Office, choose accessible locations and a week. Use Daily or Weekly on the Sales leaderboard; gold, silver and bronze medals and row highlights mark the top three places. Daily has its own date selector. Open a location row to see Reporting for those dates.

3
00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:54.542
Step 3: Your greeting sits at the top of the company-tinted Your work panel. The Home guide and selected store’s details sit beside the dashboard name. Review your active checklists, training and trainer sign-offs. Unread Comms is grouped into Groups, Direct messages and Posts, with avatars and unread badges. Choose an item to open its normal screen. Use Show all for more items; completing work or marking posts read removes them after refresh.

4
00:00:54.542 --> 00:01:05.125
Step 4: On a store dashboard, use Today and This hour for projected sales and labour budget, compare saved hourly sales, and review ordering, checklists, published staff shifts and quick links.

5
00:01:05.125 --> 00:01:16.333
Step 5: Use Edit Home on a computer to customise the company layout. Head Office, Store and Staff layouts are independent; existing custom sections and the company’s colours, fonts and logos are retained.
